{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Moon Guildhouse Simulator is a cozy cooking game where you serve drinks to our loyal guild members! You might even run into some familiar Vtubers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Man our drinks bar and learn the ins and outs of each station. Each station has different equipment and drinks to master. <br> <br>Our state of the art coffee station offers espressos, lattes, and americanos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is an early build of the game but please feel free to play and give feedback!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3eCoffee Section</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3eShift Mode - Play for a certain amount of time and make and many drinks as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3eChill Mode - Play indefinitely and make drinks to your heart's content!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4070800?t=1760375736","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4070800?t=1760375736","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070800/ba5f3aa3edcf92492a62b964d85d53ef3b539384/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760375736","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4070800/ba5f3aa3edcf92492a62b964d85d53ef3b539384/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760375736","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Moon Guildhouse Simu